<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Primac requests trading halt - ASX.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Primac requests trading halt - ASX.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchnage said on Friday Primac Holdings Ltd has requested a trading halt in its shares.  </p>
<p>Primac shares closed one cent lower at A$2.85 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Primac, a pastoral group, is currently subject to a takeover bid by rural services group IAMA Ltd, which is offering nine of its shares for every 10 Primac shares.</p>
<p>Primac directors have said the offer appeared inadequate.</p>
<p>Newspaper reports have said that Primac is in talks with rival rural groups Wesfarmers Ltd and Elders Australia Ltd.</p>
<p>Primac's annual meeting is scheduled for later on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
